  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Given below are two statements :</p><p>Statement I : Tropolone is an aromatic compound and has <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></math>&nbsp;electrons.</p><p>Statement II : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#960;</mi></math> electrons of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> group in tropolone is involved in aromaticity. In the light of the above statements choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "Statement I is true but Statement II is false",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Statement I is false but Statement II is true",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Both Statement I and Statement II are false",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Both Statement I and Statement II are true",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0131_8aeee5fddfbf.png\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 145px;\" /></p><p>Tropolone is an aromatic compound and has <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></math>electrons (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>&#960;e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math>are endocyclic and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>&#960;e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math> are exocyclic) and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></math>&nbsp;electrons of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>&nbsp;group in tropolone is not involved in aromaticity.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0131_ff1542fcf650.png\" style=\"width: 367px; height: 133px;\" /></p>"
  }
